<title>THAILAND: Siam Makro 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Siam Makro 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  3.42     vs	    2.81</p>
<p>    Net			 763.47     vs	  619.36</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Siam Makro Plc, a discount store operator.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-6520642</p>
</text>
